{"4149250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Hard Way", "steam_appid": 4149250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hard Way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hard Way is a 2D platformer designed to be extremely difficult. Embark on an adventure focused on precision, perfect timing, and absolute character control. There is no leniency, and there are no shortcuts: This is the hardest path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Key Gameplay Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unforgiving Challenge: This game is aimed at players looking for a true challenge. You will face cleverly designed levels that demand mastery, not luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable for All Ages: Despite its extreme difficulty, the game is designed to be a clean, fun experience, appropriate for all age groups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense Experience: You can complete the main game in a relatively short time, but achieving true mastery will require hours of continuous practice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proof of Skill: This is your game to prove you are the best. Can you achieve the impossible?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Completion Challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We challenge anyone to fully complete (beat) this entire game. If you believe you are a platforming professional, The Hard Way is the challenge you have been waiting for</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hard Way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hard Way is a 2D platformer designed to be extremely difficult. Embark on an adventure focused on precision, perfect timing, and absolute character control. There is no leniency, and there are no shortcuts: This is the hardest path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Key Gameplay Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unforgiving Challenge: This game is aimed at players looking for a true challenge. You 